    <!-- ================= Disclaimer ================= -->
    <string name="disclaimer_title">Before you start</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_kicker">Read once — the app won\'t ask again</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_body">This tool runs a WPS Pixie Dust audit on Wi-Fi networks you are allowed to test.

• Use it only on your own network, or with written permission from its owner. Testing a network without permission is illegal in most countries.
• Each run sends exactly one WPS transaction. It never retries, never bypasses a lockout, and never floods a network.
• A router can lock WPS after a few failures. That lockout is real and may need a physical reboot.
• No root, no wpa_supplicant, no online PIN brute force: only Pixie Dust, captured over a supported USB adapter.
• The PIN and the password are kept in the app\'s private history on this phone. They are never written to the log lines and never leave the device.
• The app has no INTERNET permission, so nothing leaves the phone.

By continuing you confirm that you understand this and that you have the right to test the networks you select.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_accept">I have permission — continue</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_decline">Quit</string>

